{"2811960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "World Without Reason", "steam_appid": 2811960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811960/extras/085ee539d1c7eb9bd90096cc0834e6c6.avif?t=1741491064\" width=616 height=568 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two years ago in the autumn of 2043, a mysterious figure known as the “Shadow Reaper” tore through the city-state of Calloway City before suddenly vanishing, taking 24 foreign Peacekeepers with him. Almost a year later in the summer of 2044, the Shadow Reaper struck again, this time causing a whopping 32 members of the Calloway City senate to fall into a coma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811960/extras/64fc0321b127ae69030394c086731193.avif?t=1741491064\" width=616 height=597 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Miss Audacity, a callow youth who witnessed Shadow Reaper in the act. Help her remember the key details of the case and bring the Reaper to justice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reach a happy ending in this tragic tale of loss, adversity, redemption, and self determination?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811960/extras/f1f164cb1c39a2fb68a1fb4098156f25.avif?t=1741491064\" width=616 height=601 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This visual novel features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Without Reason:</strong> A story of loss, adversity, and redemption </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nice Weekend Read:</strong> 5-6 hours for story completion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Them's Fightin' Words:</strong> 4 Boss fights and 1 verbal assault</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Putting a Voice to a Name:</strong> Partial voice acting for the main cast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erm, Actually:</strong> A full glossary containing all characters, locations, and tricky terminology </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life Has Many Doors:</strong> 1 main ending, 6 alternate endings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall of Crazy:</strong> A chapter map showing all major events in chronological order</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City of Secrets:</strong> Calloway City is filled with mysteries, some of which are best left alone  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811960/extras/5bb55e754cb183a74e1dfa89134900d1.avif?t=1741491064\" width=616 height=597 /></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811960/extras/085ee539d1c7eb9bd90096cc0834e6c6.avif?t=1741491064\" width=616 height=568 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two years ago in the autumn of 2043, a mysterious figure known as the “Shadow Reaper” tore through the city-state of Calloway City before suddenly vanishing, taking 24 foreign Peacekeepers with him. Almost a year later in the summer of 2044, the Shadow Reaper struck again, this time causing a whopping 32 members of the Calloway City senate to fall into a coma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811960/extras/64fc0321b127ae69030394c086731193.avif?t=1741491064\" width=616 height=597 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Miss Audacity, a callow youth who witnessed Shadow Reaper in the act. Help her remember the key details of the case and bring the Reaper to justice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reach a happy ending in this tragic tale of loss, adversity, redemption, and self determination?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811960/extras/f1f164cb1c39a2fb68a1fb4098156f25.avif?t=1741491064\" width=616 height=601 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This visual novel features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Without Reason:</strong> A story of loss, adversity, and redemption </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nice Weekend Read:</strong> 5-6 hours for story completion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Them's Fightin' Words:</strong> 4 Boss fights and 1 verbal assault</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Putting a Voice to a Name:</strong> Partial voice acting for the main cast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erm, Actually:</strong> A full glossary containing all characters, locations, and tricky terminology </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life Has Many Doors:</strong> 1 main ending, 6 alternate endings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall of Crazy:</strong> A chapter map showing all major events in chronological order</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City of Secrets:</strong> Calloway City is filled with mysteries, some of which are best left alone  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811960/extras/5bb55e754cb183a74e1dfa89134900d1.avif?t=1741491064\" width=616 height=597 /></span></p><